==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=pharmacy (disambiguation)|pharmacy}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|farmacie|lang=fro}} (modern French {{term|pharmacie|lang=fr}}), from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{term|pharmacia|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|lang=grc|φαρμακεία||the use of drugs}}, from {{term|φάρμακον||a drug, charm, enchantment|lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|φαρμακίς||witch|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈfɑɹməsi/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈfɑːməsi/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-us-pharmacy.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-uk-pharmacy.ogg|Audio (UK)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|pharmacies}}

# {{qual|countable}} A place where [[prescription]] drugs are [[dispensed]], a [[dispensary]].
# {{qual|uncountable}} The science of medicinal substances comprising [[pharmaceutics]], [[pharmaceutical]] [[chemistry]], [[pharmacology]], [[phytochemistry]] and [[forensics]].
#  {{qual|uncountable}} The occupation of a [[pharmacist]].

